title: 如何：在程序集上使用允许部分信任调用器策略进行签名
ms.date: 03/30/2017
helpviewer_keywords:
- partial trusted callers
- code signing, partial trusted callers
- permissions [.NET Framework], code signing
ms.assetid: 0aff6a5f-fdd0-4e64-affe-c51c9040b4f5
author: rpetrusha
ms.author: ronpet
ms.openlocfilehash: 61ebcd4f031ef9df805e79ebeb1e1491b7e1eb2b
